  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From the following lewis structures of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>IF</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msubsup><mi>ICl</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>:<br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/71fb8ea8-a496-494d-95d4-1a709cb41a09-17.PNG\" style=\"width: 134px; height: 150px;\" />,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/2428e40c-8804-4e82-a8c7-fdb63599c5aa-18.PNG\" style=\"width: 173px; height: 150px;\" />,&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/aed2004b-6c76-433d-a0aa-f7443277adbd-20.PNG\" style=\"width: 124px; height: 150px;\" />&nbsp;and&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dbcfc661-5a32-4bee-bde5-0f30fd7fb402-21.PNG\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 64px;\" /><br />we can deduce the number of lone pairs as well as the hybridisation of the central atom:<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>IF</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>zero</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msubsup><mi>ICl</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>two</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>one</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>three</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>lone</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pair</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>sp</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math>",
